00:12:47.360 --> 00:12:54.960
time cognitive control working memory executive uh&nbsp;
you know function and what tasks measure them um&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:54.960 --> 00:13:01.360
that tasks that we use as scientists um and sort&nbsp;
of how the different things map onto each other&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:01.360 --> 00:13:07.200
based on basically what the field is already doing&nbsp;
so this is just a summary of what is actually&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:13.200
going on in cognitive psychology and cognitive&nbsp;
neuroscience and cognitive sciences more broadly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:14.800 --> 00:13:21.200
um and as you can see uh this you know similar to&nbsp;
what ardoc is trying to do the goal here is that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:21.200 --> 00:13:27.600
if you uh you know understand a particular process&nbsp;
like response inhibition um which we then map onto&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:32.560
a brain region which we think well the trilateral&nbsp;
